        {"zh": "静止即是致命！", "en": "Stillness is deadly!"},
        {"zh": "暗中守望，等待猎物！", "en": "Stalking in shadows, waiting for prey!"},
        {"zh": "永远的守夜者，永不眠！", "en": "Eternal night watcher, never sleeps!"},
        {"zh": "看不见的威胁，永恒饥饿！", "en": "Invisible threat, endless hunger!"},
        {"zh": "你太靠近了，醒来吧！", "en": "You're too close, awaken!"},
        {"zh": "死亡之地，我的领地！", "en": "Death land, my domain!"},
        {"zh": "我站了几百年，终于动了。", "en": "I stood for centuries; now I move."},
        {"zh": "你的行动，唤醒了我！", "en": "Your movements, awakened me!"},
        {"zh": "看不见的生物，永恒的存在！", "en": "Invisible creature, eternal existence!"},
        {"zh": "静止的躯壳睁开了眼。", "en": "The still body opens its eyes."},
        {"zh": "古肉的气味把我唤醒。", "en": "The scent of ancient meat wakes me."},
        {"zh": "我从不眠的守望里站起。", "en": "I rise out of sleepless watching."},
        {"zh": "死地又少了一个安静角落。", "en": "The dead land has one less quiet corner."}
